{"id":"maravilla","lemma":"maravilla","pos":"noun","rank":1837,"glosses":["wonder, marvel","marigold","four o'clock flower"],"ipa":"/maɾaˈbiʝa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"maravillas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-maravilla.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ella canta de maravilla.","en":"She sings very well.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636455"},{"text":"La medicina hizo maravillas.","en":"The medicine worked marvels.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/39118"},{"text":"Lo pasamos de maravilla.","en":"We had a glorious time.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/831122"},{"text":"Venecia en Italia es una de las maravillas del mundo.","en":"Venice, Italy is one of the wonders of the world."},{"text":"Tu pelo huele de maravilla.","en":"Your hair smells wonderful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611820"}]}